      "message": "Thanks for the detailed explanation, I\u0027ll mark this as resolved\n\nI can also look into `getChannel()`.  I\u0027m not sure if there\u0027s a process we\u0027d need to go through to unhide it, but I\u0027d ideally want to understand why it was hidden before we go ahead and try to change it.",
