      "side": 1,
      "message": "marking as unresolved again (sorry)\n\nWe use SOCKET_CHANNEL_AUTO_STATIC_NO_SDP when we want to auto-assign the channel.  Do you see a case where you are specifically looking for -1?  \n\nre: `getChannel()`, there\u0027s no intention on unhiding it as of now, so for now it\u0027s okay to just use `getPsm()`.",
